{"id":"616941","name":"白萝卜猪肉粉条馅包子","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/616941/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"一个"},{"name":"五花肉馅","amount":"六两"},{"name":"粉条","amount":"一把"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"一根"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"三棵"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"少许"},{"name":"纯净水(40度左右)","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"肉馅备用。","img":"images/616941/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"泡好的粉条，切段备用，如图所示。","img":"images/616941/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"白萝卜洗净，削皮，擦丝。","img":"images/616941/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"焯水三分钟，捞出。","img":"images/616941/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"挤出多余水分备用。","img":"images/616941/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"白萝卜丝切一下和肉馅、粉条一起放入盆中。","img":"images/616941/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"葱和香菜切碎备用。","img":"images/616941/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"再放入葱和香菜，加适量盐、少许生抽、老抽、五香粉和鸡精调味，拌匀即可。","img":"images/616941/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"面粉中加酵母和温水，搅拌成絮状，醒发两倍大，揉成光滑面团。","img":"images/616941/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"搓成长条状，切成大小均的剂子。","img":"images/616941/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"擀成中间厚四周薄的包子皮。","img":"images/616941/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"包入馅料。","img":"images/616941/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"已包好。","img":"images/616941/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"冷水上笼，大火烧开转中火蒸二十分钟。","img":"images/616941/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"关火焖五分钟。","img":"images/616941/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"已蒸好。","img":"images/616941/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/616941/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"软软的。","img":"images/616941/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"掰开，香味扑鼻。","img":"images/616941/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}